Hi,
no, there's no conceptual problem with those continuous
"interactions". having lat&long as covariates can help the spde focus
on the local variability instead of global spatial trends.
However, the specific context and domain size will determine whether
it makes sense for that large scale spatial structure to be completely
unrelated from year to year.

Finn

